Git status of a Worker Group configuration.
All fields optional — API may return partial status.
Fields# Field Type Required Description commit str Yes Commit hash of the currently committed configuration version. localChanges int Yes Number of local configuration changes not yet committed. log list[GitCommitParam] Yes List of recent configuration commits. Used by# client.groups.update() Example# Copyfrom cribl_python_sdk.models import GitStatusParam obj: GitStatusParam = { "commit": "example", "localChanges": 0, "log": [], }
